# Code style

Aligned with `docs/JAVASCRIPT-GUIDE.md` and existing `projects/` / `libs/` sources.

- 2-space indent; semicolons as in surrounding file
- TypeScript strict; prefer `const` + arrows; standalone Angular components
- Chrome callbacks OK in services; async/await in background Gemini fetch
- User-facing strings in English
- No Node APIs in extension runtime bundles except build scripts under `scripts/`

There is no Prettier/ESLint — do not introduce config unless the user asks; if added, wire into `AGENTS.md` quality matrix.
